// test-report-writer.unit.test.ts — plan 07a41ec6 T5（openspec efficiency-first-closure
// 「The testing report is generated by the harness and concludes per axis」）
//
// 钉住：生成的报告能被既有解析器逐格读回、与 timing/trace 对账零失配、结论按轴确定性派生
